# Secrets. API keys must never be committed -- and note that any variable
# prefixed NEXT_PUBLIC_ is inlined into the browser bundle by Next.js, so a
# key placed there is published to every visitor. Provider keys belong in the
# backend environment only (see nlu/connection_advisor.py).
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
